      "message": "Merge issue/533-wire-iso-post into issue/534-wire-verify (posting_wire.rs, posting.rs, wire_contour.rs: keep both)\n\nposting_wire.rs holds #533's Wire Contour stream (op_streams builds the\nwire section through it) and #534's wire clause (verification_report's\nkerf, threading and slug laws); posting.rs mounts it once as `wire` and\nre-exports the clause. wire_contour.rs asserts the combined truth: the\nmachine note says the wire laws judge at the post, and the wire cut\nstreams with its condition for the wire post.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
